{
  "title": "Juicy Velvety Portuguese Chicken Stew",
  "description": "This Portuguese chicken stew is a floral and velvety dish featuring sesame butter and bhuna, making it a high-protein-friendly meal option. It is a cozy and comforting dish perfect for a cold evening.",
  "cuisine": "Portuguese",
  "diet": [
